OL,5,
OL,6,FBut Conservative leader Kemi Badenoch
OL,7,Fsays reopening the Brexit debate is
OL,8,F"the last thing our country needs"
OL,10,FMeanwhile, Burnham says he will ignore
OL,11,F"stuck in the past" former prime
OL,12,Fministers who have criticised his
OL,13,Fapproach to the EU - what have they
OL,14,Fsaid?
